    "All six source groups and every declaration context were reviewed against printed pp.373\u2013374. Only the outside-source positive-reach parenthesis remains prose.",
    "The original minimizing relation is independently specified, proved to exist and unique under convexity, then sealed. Retraction and nonexpansion are derived public laws.",
